      },
      "details": "{\"id\": \"claim:pair-f78c2e29d7f637cc2bc2\", \"subject\": \"object:mpo-1385\", \"predicate\": \"same_codex\", \"object\": \"object:mpo-20274\", \"basis\": \"researcher_interpretation\", \"status\": \"previously_documented\", \"source_stance\": \"asserted\", \"polarity\": \"positive\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"source_statement_date\": null, \"scope\": \"book relationship\", \"provenance\": [{\"source\": \"source:36fb90793e201dc844e5\", \"locator\": \"H01\"}], \"supports\": [], \"challenges\": [], \"support_notes\": [\"Both images show broadly compatible one-column music layouts. No shared boundary or distinctive variant establishing identity was found in this screen.\", \"Two visible antiphon incipits agree with the office sequence in Hallqvist2020 edited C435, printedp6/PDF53. The higher-resolution invitatory comparison now distinguishes edited C435, its apparatus-reported manuscript state and edited C23 (PDF67).\", \"Two actual C23 source pages were acquired from Uppsala Alvin. A declared ten-site comparison retains eight target-evaluable word/structure sites and two unavailable target sites; corrected text, cancelled text and editorial reports remain separate.\"], \"challenge_notes\": [\"Different catalogue occasions do not contradict one book; shared broad layout cannot independently confirm it.\", \"The short comparison established no distinctive variant: agreement with a published office sequence is shared liturgical evidence, not independent evidence for the proposed physical association.\", \"The apparent absence of separate pium and Matri…condolentes before procida… agree with the standard edited wording, not a unique book fingerprint. The edition reports different states for C435. No direct inspection of C435 manuscript images is claimed.\", \"No hymn entry is visible between Venite and Immolandus in the inspected continuous target region. This is a written-layout observation; abbreviated practice, different book function or a hymn elsewhere remain alternatives.\", \"No distinctive shared uncorrected C23 reading is established. Seven selected sites give current/standard word or cue agreements; the eighth has a visible C23 hymn entry where the target continuous region has none. These are not eight independent identity features or a transmission tree.\"], \"source_locator\": null, \"contextual_evidence\": [\"evidence:O-mpo-20274\", \"evidence:O-mpo-1385\", \"evidence:O-mpo-20274-1-13\", \"evidence:O-mpo-20274-2-14\", \"evidence:O-mpo-20274-2-15\", \"evidence:O-mpo-20274-2-16\", \"evidence:V-1385-clipped-mark\", \"evidence:T-20274-invitatory\", \"evidence:T-20274-order\", \"evidence:T-20274-transition\", \"evidence:T-20274-patri-parens\", \"evidence:T-20274-dampnatur\", \"evidence:T-20274-eructavit-rident\"], \"lead_id\": \"pair-f78c2e29d7f637cc2bc2\"}"
    },
