      "details": "{\"id\": \"claim:pair-d1b9840d2e187b72bb21\", \"subject\": \"object:mpo-1385\", \"predicate\": \"same_codex\", \"object\": \"object:mpo-4223\", \"basis\": \"researcher_interpretation\", \"status\": \"unresolved\", \"source_stance\": \"suggested\", \"polarity\": \"positive\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"source_statement_date\": null, \"scope\": \"book relationship\", \"provenance\": [{\"source\": \"source:36fb90793e201dc844e5\", \"locator\": \"H08\"}], \"supports\": [], \"challenges\": [], \"support_notes\": [\"Fr4223 resembles Fr1385 in broad layout and damaged parchment geometry. It is catalogued within Ant39/Codex1200 with a Västerås attribution.\"], \"challenge_notes\": [\"Known grouping, shared broad production traits and similar damaged dimensions are simpler explanations of a high score. Decoration differs, but this is not conclusive scribe discrimination.\", \"Selected decorated initials provide a control for shared ornamental vocabulary; resemblance in these traits is not unique to H02 and cannot identify a book or scribe.\", \"Letter-controlled examples are now retained separately: selected Ant39 A samples differ from the H02 A samples, while the R comparison is incomplete for red fill/lozenges. This local contrast establishes no rarity, common hand or physical exclusion.\", \"The BOMPAC combined reconstruction workbook assigns Fr 4223 to BOMPAC-258 (Ant-39/Codex-1200/FM.IV.159) and Fr 1385 to BOMPAC-912 (Ant-99/FM.IV.157); its raw MPO workbook similarly places the candidate in C-17 and Fr 1385 in singleton F-1385. These are published reconstruction assignments, not fresh image proof or independent adjudication. They weigh against treating the model suggestion as a new same-codex match but do not by themselves disprove physical connection, a shared hand, or broader production context.\"], \"source_locator\": null, \"contextual_evidence\": [\"evidence:O-mpo-1385\", \"evidence:O-mpo-4223-1-4\", \"evidence:V-1385-clipped-mark\", \"evidence:V-H08-4223-initial\", \"evidence:C20-A-1385\", \"evidence:C20-A-4223\"], \"lead_id\": \"pair-d1b9840d2e187b72bb21\"}"
    },
