      "details": "{\"id\": \"claim:pair-dd801424ce2ad9ecda18\", \"subject\": \"object:mpo-8201\", \"predicate\": \"suggested_association\", \"object\": \"object:mpo-9620\", \"basis\": \"computational_suggestion\", \"status\": \"unresolved\", \"source_stance\": \"suggested\", \"polarity\": \"positive\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:matcher\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"source_statement_date\": null, \"scope\": \"book relationship\", \"provenance\": [{\"source\": \"source:340f945088b424d674d1\", \"locator\": \"pair-dd801424ce2ad9ecda18\"}], \"supports\": [], \"challenges\": [], \"support_notes\": [\"Saved compatibility ranking only; no new direct pair-level source interpretation was performed by this triage.\", \"Later Catherine-office material and the published continuation phrase; no second complete local opening established. / Invitatory heading and Jacob passage with dixit/vere/locus-iste context; earlier antiphon candidate retained.\"], \"challenge_notes\": [\"Shared style, liturgy, inherited metadata and capture appearance remain explanations; differing catalogue assignments are not automatic negatives.\", \"BOMPAC-4861 includes the published8201/8304 different-book control. The unit cannot serve as independent same-codex ground truth for its other member pairs.\", \"The known8201/8304 different-book pair also shares the observed general ruling/layout; this feature cannot establish the candidate identity. The selected surviving contexts do not establish a complete corresponding diagnostic passage. Different feasts/genres and shared generic cues do not exclude one book. This is not an exhaustive chant census or a claim of no possible correspondence.\"], \"source_locator\": null, \"contextual_evidence\": [], \"lead_id\": \"pair-dd801424ce2ad9ecda18\"}"
