      "details": "{\"id\": \"claim:pair-6392b3d5ccd2551daf9d\", \"subject\": \"object:mpo-8343\", \"predicate\": \"same_codex\", \"object\": \"object:mpo-8344\", \"basis\": \"researcher_interpretation\", \"status\": \"previously_documented\", \"source_stance\": \"asserted\", \"polarity\": \"positive\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"source_statement_date\": null, \"scope\": \"book relationship\", \"provenance\": [{\"source\": \"source:d94dbd9171cf5d966199\", \"locator\": \"pair-6392b3d5ccd2551daf9d\"}], \"supports\": [], \"challenges\": [], \"support_notes\": [\"manuscript type: compatibility 1.000; this is not an identity probability.\", \"script: compatibility 1.000; this is not an identity probability.\", \"notation: compatibility 1.000; this is not an identity probability.\", \"staff_lines: compatibility 1.000; this is not an identity probability.\", \"columns: compatibility 1.000; this is not an identity probability.\", \"lines: compatibility 1.000; this is not an identity probability.\", \"leaf_cm: compatibility 1.000; this is not an identity probability.\", \"written_cm: compatibility 0.882; this is not an identity probability.\", \"catalogue date range: compatibility 1.000; this is not an identity probability.\", \"shared catalogue content terms: pascha\", \"Catalogue type: Graduale / Graduale.\", \"Notation: Quadr / Quadr.\", \"Fr 8343's selected capture ends an Ego sum pastor bonus passage and then writes Alleluia. Fr 8344 capture 3 opens Surrexit Christus et illuxit. This is consistent with the catalogued sequence but is only a generic chant boundary; it does not independently establish immediate adjacency.\", \"The final row Iubilate deo ... psalmum dicite nomini eius is continued by date gloriam laudi eius at the top of the other object, before the doxology cue and next Alleluia. This supports the previously catalogued direction of the Vocem iucunditatis verse continuation.\"], \"challenge_notes\": [\"Compatibility score is not an identity probability.\", \"Text/chant continuity, individual letterforms and physical joins have not been independently verified.\", \"Current target-specific novelty is uncleared until later scholarship and expert review.\", \"Image similarity can reflect shared script, notation, damage, capture background or workshop rather than one codex.\", \"Source metadata may inherit reconstructed-group descriptions; it is not independent physical evidence.\", \"No external specialist has adjudicated this computational suggestion.\", \"Alleluia alone is not diagnostic.\", \"A text match to an office antiphon must not silently assign its ID or melody to this Mass alleluia.\", \"The catalogue side mapping and immediate adjacency remain provisional at source-image level.\", \"A standard psalm verse is not a unique textual variant or codex fingerprint.\", \"No physical join, complete bifolium collation or independent historical confirmation follows.\", \"The side mapping is interpreted through catalogue contents and source words; no general capture-ordinal rule or feast-number correction is claimed.\"], \"source_locator\": null, \"contextual_evidence\": [], \"lead_id\": \"pair-6392b3d5ccd2551daf9d\"}"
