ist\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Pixel regions identify inspected areas, not original dimensions.\", \"No folio-side, date, scribe or manuscript identity established.\", \"No note-level transcription attempted.\"], \"image_dimensions\": [600, 400]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:O-mpo-4223-1-4\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"O-mpo-4223-1-4\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-4223.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-4223.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=65,55,540,380\"}}, \"sha256\": \"96ba47f174b1bc2a25d9ae088dc17ac336bd294da2e357ec0f6dca3acc85a73f\", \"observation\": \"Broad single column with square-shaped notes on red ruling; a decorated dark initial and damaged lower writing area are visible. Similarity is not individual-hand evidence.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1004223_00001/full/800,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"O-mpo-4223-1-4\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Broad single column with square-shaped notes on red ruling; a decorated dark initial and damaged lower writing area are visible. Similarity is not individual-hand evidence.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-4223.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=65,55,540,380\"}}, \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-4223\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1004223_00001/full/800,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"96ba47f174b1bc2a25d9ae088dc17ac336bd294da2e357ec0f6dca3acc85a73f\", \"image_dime