.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=455,242,445,112\"}}, \"sha256\": \"3c34578256735768d0a0682b61758255397dc2073f226c9bc8ffd8048f62606d\", \"observation\": \"The large initial and following words identify the opening of the matins antiphon printed in Hallqvist2020, p6, lines221–227. Remaining words on lower lines are not silently completed as a diplomatic transcription.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1020274_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-20274\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1020274_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"3c34578256735768d0a0682b61758255397dc2073f226c9bc8ffd8048f62606d\", \"image_dimensions\": [1000, 929], \"observer\": \"Codex AI visual inspection, 2026-10-22; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"image observation\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI reading and local edition comparison; no independent expert adjudication\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Common office text and sequence do not establish manuscript identity.\", \"No distinctive shared variant or musical pitches established.\", \"Capture order is not a folio-side assignment.\"], \"id\": \"O-mpo-20274-2-15\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The large initial and following words identify the opening of the matins antiphon printed in Hallqvist2020, p6, lines221–227. Remaining words on lower lines are not silently completed as a diplomatic transcription.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=455,242,445,112\"}}, \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"Immolandus ligna gerit\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"Immolandus ligna gerit\", \"certainty\": \"provisional image reading; normalized spelling and identification checked against the edition, not independently adjudicated\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=53\"]}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:O-mpo-20274-2-16\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"O-mpo-20274-2-16\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=64,568,843,238\"}}, \"sha256\": \"3c34578256735768d0a0682b61758255397dc2073f226c9bc8ffd8048f62606d\", \"observation\": \"The following large initial begins the next antiphon in the same capture. Its candidate incipit agrees with the next antiphon in Hallqvist2020, p6, line233. Line wrapping is retained; later words are not transcribed.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1020274_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-20274\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1020274_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"3c34578256735768d0a0682b61758255397dc2073f226c9bc8ffd8048f62606d\", \"image_dimensions\": [1000, 929], \"observer\": \"Codex AI visual inspection, 2026-10-22; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"image observation\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI reading and local edition comparison; no independent expert adjudication\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Common office text and sequence do not establish manuscript identity.\", \"No distinctive shared variant or musical pitches established.\", \"Capture order is not a folio-side assignment.\"], \"id\": \"O-mpo-20274-2-16\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The following large initial begins the next antiphon in the same capture. Its candidate incipit agrees with the next antiphon in Hallqvist2020, p6, line233. Line wrapping is retained; later words are not transcribed.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=64,568,843,238\"}}, \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"Caluum rident helise / um\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"Calvum rident Heliseum\", \"certainty\": \"provisional image reading; normalized spelling and identification checked against the edition, not independently adjudicated\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=53\"]}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:V-10370-mark\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"V-10370-mark\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-10370-capture-1-1700px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-1-1700px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=754,77,100,85\"}}, \"sha256\": \"07efe2e1f8f87f31156630a7fe5340f78600c78ddc31d7fad930e5ae81f8a409\", \"observation\": \"The upper-margin red sign has two principal strokes, the second descending/curving. Candidate diplomatic reading ij; compatible with the source catalogue normalization II. It is not a secure side assignment.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00001/full/1700,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"V-10370-mark\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-10370\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The upper-margin red sign has two principal strokes, the second descending/curving. Candidate diplomatic reading ij; compatible with the source catalogue normalization II. It is not a secure side assignment.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-1-1700px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=754,77,100,85\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00001/full/1700,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"07efe2e1f8f87f31156630a7fe5340f78600c78ddc31d7fad930e5ae81f8a409\", \"image_dimensions\": [1700, 1417], \"observer\": \"Codex AI visual-source agent, 2026-10-22; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source inspection; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading_note\": \"Candidate ij / normalized II; provisional AI reading\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"No new same-book, same-hand, decorator or provenance attribution.\", \"Source photograph index is not a medieval folio-side assignment.\", \"AI-agent agreement is not independent corroboration.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:V-10370-overlap-upper\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"V-10370-overlap-upper\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-10370-capture-1-1700px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-1-1700px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=234,1290,1179,127\"}}, \"sha256\": \"07efe2e1f8f87f31156630a7fe5340f78600c78ddc31d7fad930e5ae81f8a409\", \"observation\": \"The bottom of manifest image1 contains the upper portion of a large pale/grey ornamental initial with red shaft/lozenge at the left of the next music system. A complementary lower initial portion is visible at the top of image2. This is consistent with successive partial views of one writing surface, but no pixel-overlap registration or shared complete text row has been established in this check. Image ordinal alone cannot establish side.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00001/full/1700,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"V-10370-overlap-upper\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-10370\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The bottom of manifest image1 contains the upper portion of a large pale/grey ornamental initial with red shaft/lozenge at the left of the next music system. A complementary lower initial portion is visible at the top of image2. This is consistent with successive partial views of one writing surface, but no pixel-overlap registration or shared complete text row has been established in this check. Image ordinal alone cannot establish side.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-1-1700px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=234,1290,1179,127\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00001/full/1700,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"07efe2e1f8f87f31156630a7fe5340f78600c78ddc31d7fad930e5ae81f8a409\", \"image_dimensions\": [1700, 1417], \"observer\": \"Codex AI visual-source agent, 2026-10-22; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source inspection; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading_note\": \"No new text reading; graphic/capture correspondence\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"No new same-book, same-hand, decorator or provenance attribution.\", \"Source photograph index is not a medieval folio-side assignment.\", \"AI-agent agreement is not independent corroboration.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:V-10370-overlap-lower\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"V-10370-overlap-lower\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-10370-capture-2-1739px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-2-1739px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=232,25,1163,100\"}}, \"sha256\": \"fe8019fd85f078f5f552e9aa4befbae21bee8522506a1f77385d032a0499ee58\", \"observation\": \"The top of manifest image2 contains a lower portion of a pale/grey ornamental initial and following text; its upper paper margin is rolled/folded over. It is compatible with continuation of image1, not by itself proof of an opposite side. The kmark was subsequently observed on image3, not in this band. Exact pixel overlap remains unregistered.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00002/full/1739,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"V-10370-overlap-lower\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-10370\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The top of manifest image2 contains a lower portion of a pale/grey ornamental initial and following text; its upper paper margin is rolled/folded over. It is compatible with continuation of image1, not by itself proof of an opposite side. The kmark was subsequently observed on image3, not in this band. Exact pixel overlap remains unregistered.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-2-1739px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=232,25,1163,100\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00002/full/1739,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"fe8019fd85f078f5f552e9aa4befbae21bee8522506a1f77385d032a0499ee58\", \"image_dimensions\": [1739, 1132], \"observer\": \"Codex AI visual-source agent, 2026-10-22; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source inspection; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading_note\": \"Candidate following text begins Ecce; complete seam/side reconstruction remains provisional\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"No new same-book, same-hand, decorator or provenance attribution.\", \"Source photograph index is not a medieval folio-side assignment.\", \"AI-agent agreement is not independent corroboration.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:V-1385-clipped-mark\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"V-1385-clipped-mark\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-1385.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-1385.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=270,30,90,48\"}}, \"sha256\": \"99b62db72f5b1b359c7422cf48532c564cce51c83f1485606c7d200502a441b1\", \"observation\": \"A small red upper-margin mark is clipped by the surviving/top image edge. The available pixels do not securely distinguish the catalogue readings IX and D or assign this photograph to recto/verso.\