fa90af8f6de28b\", \"image_dimensions\": [1728, 1233], \"observer\": \"Codex AI visual-source agent, 2026-10-22; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source inspection; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading_note\": \"k; provisional AI reading\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"No new same-book or different-book conclusion.\", \"Source photograph ordinal is not a medieval folio-side assignment.\", \"CandidateII/kmark readings do not themselves determine which surface is medieval recto.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:V-10370-no-seam-34\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"V-10370-no-seam-34\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-10370-capture-4-1742px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-4-1742px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=300,0,1180,190\"}}, \"sha256\": \"2f2d35bf4253989714fda7877403a48bc4cd58bffa2e893469968546a9c1594f\", \"observation\": \"The uppermost visible medieval text/ruling and broad B-like central ornamental initial were compared with the lower portion of image3. I could not establish a literal shared text row or exact graphic seam. No3/4overlap or complete same-surface stitch is inferred merely from ordinal order.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00004/full/1742,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"V-10370-no-seam-34\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-10370\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The uppermost visible medieval text/ruling and broad B-like central ornamental initial were compared with the lower portion of image3. I could not establish a literal shared text row or exact graphic seam. No3/4overlap or complete same-surface stitch is inferred merely from ordinal order.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-4-1742px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=300,0,1180,190\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00004/full/1742,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"2f2d35bf4253989714fda7877403a48bc4cd58bffa2e893469968546a9c1594f\", \"image_dimensions\": [1742, 1219], \"observer\": \"Codex AI visual-source agent, 2026-10-22; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source inspection; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading_note\": \"No secure seam transcription\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"No new same-book or different-book conclusion.\", \"Source photograph ordinal is not a medieval folio-side assignment.\", \"CandidateII/kmark readings do not themselves determine which surface is medieval recto.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:T-20274-invitatory\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"T-20274-invitatory\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-20274-capture-1-1831px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-20274-capture-1-1831px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=880,900,900,330\"}}, \"sha256\": \"4e7be82df9d226e74079c712fc0dad62ba9d018a669822095553dbd4d4229e6a\", \"observation\": \"Christum is a proposed expansion of the visible barred christogram. No separate pium is visible between it and passum under that expansion. This is a provisional reading, not a gold transcription.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1020274_00001/full/1831,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"T-20274-invitatory\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-20274\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Christum is a proposed expansion of the visible barred christogram. No separate pium is visible between it and passum under that expansion. This is a provisional reading, not a gold transcription.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-20274-capture-1-1831px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=880,900,900,330\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1020274_00001/full/1831,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"4e7be82df9d226e74079c712fc0dad62ba9d018a669822095553dbd4d4229e6a\", \"image_dimensions\": [1831, 1565], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source reading,2026-10-22; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"image reading compared with published apparatus\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Edited text and reported manuscript states are separate sources.\", \"No identity, melodic or performance inference from common text/omission.\", \"No independent expert label, blind test or rare-variant claim.\"], \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"Recolentes xpm passum et\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"Recolentes Christum passum et\", \"certainty\": \"provisional; expansion and music-underlay spacing are explicit\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=53\", \"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\"]}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:T-20274-order\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"T-20274-order\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2-1835px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2-1835px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=80,100,1590,310\"}}, \"sha256\": \"34f88c2977098a87fbc5c2fb796f05092cc83e49574bef2d2e3ac19efe156457\", \"observation\": \"The line wraps within condolentes; Matri begins before the procida- word. Full syllabic underlay and abbreviation expansion remain provisional. Comparison concerns word order, not manuscript identity.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1020274_00002/full/1835,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"T-20274-order\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-20274\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The line wraps within condolentes; Matri begins before the procida- word. Full syllabic underlay and abbreviation expansion remain provisional. Comparison concerns word order, not manuscript identity.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2-1835px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=80,100,1590,310\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1020274_00002/full/1835,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"34f88c2977098a87fbc5c2fb796f05092cc83e49574bef2d2e3ac19efe156457\", \"image_dimensions\": [1835, 1705], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source reading,2026-10-22; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"image reading compared with published apparatus\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Edited text and reported manuscript states are separate sources.\", \"No identity, melodic or performance inference from common text/omission.\", \"No independent expert label, blind test or rare-variant claim.\"], \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"Matri sue con / do lentes procida[...]\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"Matri sue condolentes [before] procidamus\", \"certainty\": \"provisional; expansion and music-underlay spacing are explicit\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=53\", \"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\"]}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:T-20274-transition\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"T-20274-transition\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2-1835px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2-1835px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=80,400,1580,250\"}}, \"sha256\": \"34f88c2977098a87fbc5c2fb796f05092cc83e49574bef2d2e3ac19efe156457\", \"observation\": \"No intervening hymn entry is visible in this continuous region. This is an observation about this written book, not a claim that the hymn was omitted in performance or absent elsewhere.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1020274_00002/full/1835,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"T-20274-transition\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-20274\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"No intervening hymn entry is visible in this continuous region. This is an observation about this written book, not a claim that the hymn was omitted in performance or absent elsewhere.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2-1835px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=80,400,1580,250\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1020274_00002/full/1835,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"34f88c2977098a87fbc5c2fb796f05092cc83e49574bef2d2e3ac19efe156457\", \"image_dimensions\": [1835, 1705], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source reading,2026-10-22; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"image reading compared with published apparatus\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Edited text and reported manuscript states are separate sources.\", \"No identity, melodic or performance inference from common text/omission.\", \"No independent expert label, blind test or rare-variant claim.\"], \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"alleluya; ps; Venite; [red rubric]; Immolandus ligna gerit\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"Psalm Venite then nocturn rubric and Immolandus\", \"certainty\": \"provisional; expansion and music-underlay spacing are explicit\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=53\", \"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\"]}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I20-10370-verse-prefix\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I20-10370-verse-prefix\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-10370-capture-2-1739px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-2-1739px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=650,490,740,115\"}}, \"sha256\": \"fe8019fd85f078f5f552e9aa4befbae21bee8522506a1f77385d032a0499ee58\", \"observation\": \"The final written row of this photograph begins the verse: candidate Ardore caritatis succensa que with an abbreviation bar. Quem is an explicit proposed expansion. The decorated initial begins at the left edge of the selected region.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00002/full/1739,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I20-10370-verse-prefix\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-10370\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The final written row of this photograph begins the verse: candidate Ardore caritatis succensa que with an abbreviation bar. Quem is an explicit proposed expansion. The decorated initial begins at the left edge of the selected region.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-2-1739px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=650,490,740,115\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00002/full/1739,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"fe8019fd85f078f5f552e9aa4befbae21bee8522506a1f77385d032a0499ee58\", \"image_dimensions\": [1739, 1132], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source inspection, 2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"provisional image reading and external text concordance\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"[A]rdore caritatis succensa quē\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"Ardore caritatis succensa quem\", \"certainty\": \"provisional; abbreviation expansion and uncertain credens are explicit\", \"cantus_candidate\": {\"id\": \"601029a\", \"status\": \"candidate verse identification, not manuscript identity\"}, \"external_references\": [\"https://cantusdatabase.org/chant/402240/\", \"https://cantusdatabase.org/chant/564421/\", \"https://cantusdatabase.org/chant/204152/\"]}, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Long text continuation supports relative reading order, not original codex identity.\", \"No registered pixel overlap, physical stitch or direct seam is established.\", \"Roman/letter marks and relative order do not define the MPO catalogue side convention.\", \"Repeated chants or unrecognized photographic rearrangement remain alternatives.\", \"Agreement between AI readings is not independent expert corroboration.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I20-10370-verse-suffix\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I20-10370-verse-suffix\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-10370-capture-3-1728px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-3-1728px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=345,330,1155,85\"}}, \"sha256\": \"b1258668d90ca011960ab4ff85f25fb79c0c3c636ad626ceb4fa90af8f6de28b\", \"observation\": \"The first written row of the k-marked photograph continues with candidate sepultum nouerat sublatum cred[ens?] de se pul chro. The word credens is less securely read than the surrounding words; the Cantus parallel informs its proposed normalization.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00003/full/1728,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I20-10370-verse-suffix\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-10370\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The first written row of the k-marked photograph continues with candidate sepultum nouerat sublatum cred[ens?] de se pul chro. The word credens is less securely read than the surrounding words; the Cantus parallel informs its proposed normalization.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10370-capture-3-1728px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=345,330,1155,85\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010370_00003/full/1728,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"b1258668d90ca011960ab4ff85f25fb79c0c3c636ad626ceb4fa90af8f6de28b\", \"image_dimensions\": [1728, 1233], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source inspection, 2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"provisional image reading and external text concordance\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"sepultum nouerat sublatum cred[ens?] de se pul chro\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"sepultum noverat sublatum credens de sepulchro\", \"certainty\": \"provisional; abbreviation expansion and uncertain credens are explicit\", \"cantus_candidate\": {\"id\": \"601029a\", \"status\": \"candidate verse identification, not manuscript identity\"}, \"external_references\": [\"https://cantusdatabase.org/chant/402240/\", \"https://cantusdatabase.org/chant/564421/\", \"https://cantusdatabase.org/chant/204152/\"]}, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Long text continuation supports relative reading order, not original codex identity.\", \"No registered pixel overlap, physical stitch or direct seam is established.\", \"Roman/letter marks and relative order do not define the MPO catalogue side convention.\", \"Repeated chants or unrecognized photographic rearrangement remain alternatives.\", \"Agreement between AI readings is not independent expert corroboration.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C20-A-1385\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C20-A-1385\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-1385-capture-4.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-1385-capture-4.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=175,56,85,112\"}}, \"sha256\": \"b3091a8b6846d05e4e4606ff6fb71d809d8539f3681246d40247ec6914a89670\", \"observation\": \"Candidate A, followed by uertantur retrorsum. Pale body fields, a longitudinal red left-stem stripe, red upper/dark lower lozenges and a toothed dark left edge are visible. Small left-foot flourish. Compare the candidate A in10406, not only letters of other shapes.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1001385_00004/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C20-A-1385\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-1385\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Candidate A, followed by uertantur retrorsum. Pale body fields, a longitudinal red left-stem stripe, red upper/dark lower lozenges and a toothed dark left edge are visible. Small left-foot flourish. Compare the candidate A in10406, not only letters of other shapes.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-1385-capture-4.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=175,56,85,112\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1001385_00004/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"b3091a8b6846d05e4e4606ff6fb71d809d8539f3681246d40247ec6914a89670\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI source inspection,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI observation; no independent expert review\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Post-review manual selection, not blind or preregistered.\", \"Letter identity and liturgical function are candidate readings, not independent labels.\", \"No same-book, same-hand or same-decorator inference from these features.\"], \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"Auertantur retrorsum…\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"\", \"certainty\": \"Candidate A supported by following uertantur; provisional AI reading.\", \"external_references\": []}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C20-A-10406\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C20-A-10406\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-10406-capture-3.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10406-capture-3.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=248,415,80,112\"}}, \"sha256\": \"ad15525ab9eaeb67b603ade9120886e2c5c8caecb5ebfbebef9bd478a09bfbb9\", \"observation\": \"Candidate A, followed by des. Pale body fields, a longitudinal red stripe, two red lozenges and a dark toothed left contour are visible. Relative to the1385A, the right body is a more continuous curved field and the lower lozenge appears red rather than dark. Letter construction and decoration can vary within a book; no exclusion follows.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010406_00003/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C20-A-10406\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-10406\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Candidate A, followed by des. Pale body fields, a longitudinal red stripe, two red lozenges and a dark toothed left contour are visible. Relative to the1385A, the right body is a more continuous curved field and the lower lozenge appears red rather than dark. Letter construction and decoration can vary within a book; no exclusion follows.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10406-capture-3.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=248,415,80,112\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010406_00003/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"ad15525ab9eaeb67b603ade9120886e2c5c8caecb5ebfbebef9bd478a09bfbb9\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI source inspection,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI observation; no independent expert review\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Post-review manual selection, not blind or preregistered.\", \"Letter identity and liturgical function are candidate readings, not independent labels.\", \"No same-book, same-hand or same-decorator inference from these features.\"], \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"Ades…\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"\", \"certainty\": \"Candidate A supported by following des; provisional AI reading.\", \"external_references\": []}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C20-A-4223\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C20-A-4223\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-4223-capture-3.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-4223-capture-3.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=178,96,128,180\"}}, \"sha256\": \"6a23f7f6a8b8a02bc935ae87d7b120be1ca4605a5bc07664ab2718af8ac8f942\", \"observation\": \"Candidate A with a large upper-left loop, angular dark left contours and a narrow patterned upright. No comparable long red-filled shaft or pair of interior lozenges is securely visible. The precise liturgical role is not independently established, so this is not a fully role-matched exclusion control.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1004223_00003/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C20-A-4223\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-4223\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Candidate A with a large upper-left loop, angular dark left contours and a narrow patterned upright. No comparable long red-filled shaft or pair of interior lozenges is securely visible. The precise liturgical role is not independently established, so this is not a fully role-matched exclusion control.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-4223-capture-3.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=178,96,128,180\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1004223_00003/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"6a23f7f6a8b8a02bc935ae87d7b120be1ca4605a5bc07664ab2718af8ac8f942\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI source inspection,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI observation; no independent expert review\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Post-review manual selection, not blind or preregistered.\", \"Letter identity and liturgical function are candidate readings, not independent labels.\", \"No same-book, same-hand or same-decorator inference from these features.\"], \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"A p[…]hetis…\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"\", \"certainty\": \"Candidate A from shape and following text; abbreviation expansion not secured.\", \"external_references\": []}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C20-A-8311\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C20-A-8311\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-8311-capture-2.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8311-capture-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=676,330,78,134\"}}, \"sha256\": \"e3b1eba2064492294fa6f75ec6087bbacedd6a636572cf6cfe2ce43e561b46c5\", \"observation\": \"Candidate A has a narrow diagonal right leg, compartmented/lattice-like crossbar and long lower-left flourish. No long red-filled shaft or paired simple lozenges is securely visible. Its local rubric/chant function is unresolved; apparent difference is not a book or hand exclusion.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008311_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C20-A-8311\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-8311\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Candidate A has a narrow diagonal right leg, compartmented/lattice-like crossbar and long lower-left flourish. No long red-filled shaft or paired simple lozenges is securely visible. Its local rubric/chant function is unresolved; apparent difference is not a book or hand exclusion.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8311-capture-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=676,330,78,134\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008311_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"e3b1eba2064492294fa6f75ec6087bbacedd6a636572cf6cfe2ce43e561b46c5\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI source inspection,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI observation; no independent expert review\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Post-review manual selection, not blind or preregistered.\", \"Letter identity and liturgical function are candidate readings, not independent labels.\", \"No same-book, same-hand or same-decorator inference from these features.\"], \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"A […]\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"\", \"certainty\": \"Candidate A by form; complete following word not securely transcribed.\", \"external_references\": []}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C20-R-1385\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C20-R-1385\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-1385-capture-2.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-1385-capture-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=239,154,72,101\"}}, \"sha256\": \"0a3f4c6bd4b94d8616b081feebbb8e41d2460b26d3a62ecedb76218912f35f1f\", \"observation\": \"Candidate R followed by ex. Long red stem, pale body, small red/dark lozenges and toothed outer left contour. This is a same-letter comparison with the8455Reges initial, but their exact decorative/liturgical functions are not shown equivalent.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1001385_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C20-R-1385\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-1385\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Candidate R followed by ex. Long red stem, pale body, small red/dark lozenges and toothed outer left contour. This is a same-letter comparison with the8455Reges initial, but their exact decorative/liturgical functions are not shown equivalent.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-1385-capture-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=239,154,72,101\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1001385_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"0a3f4c6bd4b94d8616b081feebbb8e41d2460b26d3a62ecedb76218912f35f1f\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI source inspection,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI observation; no independent expert review\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Post-review manual selection, not blind or preregistered.\", \"Letter identity and liturgical function are candidate readings, not independent labels.\", \"No same-book, same-hand or same-decorator inference from these features.\"], \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"Rex…\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"\", \"certainty\": \"Candidate R supported by following ex.\", \"external_references\": []}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C20-R-8455\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C20-R-8455\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-8455-capture-3.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8455-capture-3.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=659,305,105,120\"}}, \"sha256\": \"d8b22f504fd2688d8b547fc01e7798d3d5294babf2b5c63c73f1afe6bcb1d4c3\", \"observation\": \"Candidate R followed by eges has a pale narrow stem/bowl and large angular teeth on the left. A red stem filling and small lozenges are not securely visible. A red verse-like marker precedes it, so function equivalence to the1385R is unverified.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008455_00003/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C20-R-8455\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-8455\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Candidate R followed by eges has a pale narrow stem/bowl and large angular teeth on the left. A red stem filling and small lozenges are not securely visible. A red verse-like marker precedes it, so function equivalence to the1385R is unverified.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8455-capture-3.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=659,305,105,120\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008455_00003/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"d8b22f504fd2688d8b547fc01e7798d3d5294babf2b5c63c73f1afe6bcb1d4c3\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI source inspection,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI observation; no independent expert review\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Post-review manual selection, not blind or preregistered.\", \"Letter identity and liturgical function are candidate readings, not independent labels.\", \"No same-book, same-hand or same-decorator inference from these features.\"], \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"Reges…\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"\", \"certainty\": \"Candidate R supported by following eges.\", \"external_references\": []}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C20-D-8201\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C20-D-8201\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-8201-capture-2.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8201-capture-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=644,98,94,105\"}}, \"sha256\": \"b598826b6164ae737a68aba17abcdc3a51573075955aa055f52fb30921196b1a\", \"observation\": \"Candidate D followed by e: broad red stem, pale right body, two dark lozenges, parallel crossbars and scalloped dark left border. This belongs to the previously published same-hand/different-book pair; the existing reference decision is not our new discovery.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008201_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C20-D-8201\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-8201\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Candidate D followed by e: broad red stem, pale right body, two dark lozenges, parallel crossbars and scalloped dark left border. This belongs to the previously published same-hand/different-book pair; the existing reference decision is not our new discovery.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8201-capture-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=644,98,94,105\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008201_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"b598826b6164ae737a68aba17abcdc3a51573075955aa055f52fb30921196b1a\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI source inspection,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI observation; no independent expert review\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Post-review manual selection, not blind or preregistered.\", \"Letter identity and liturgical function are candidate readings, not independent labels.\", \"No same-book, same-hand or same-decorator inference from these features.\"], \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"De…\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"\", \"certainty\": \"Candidate D supported by following e; initial A misidentification during inspection was corrected.\", \"external_references\": []}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C20-D-8304\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C20-D-8304\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-8304-capture-3.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8304-capture-3.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=365,210,81,90\"}}, \"sha256\": \"8e09cb844765045a79e91d4f7cc1244745f3f2f437cd16353e2784b63e0d285f\", \"observation\": \"Candidate D followed by e repeats a red stem, pale right body, small lozenge-like internal marks, parallel crossbars and dark scalloped left border. The two D samples are an auxiliary same-letter hard-negative comparison, not a test of A-specific exclusivity or an independently established common hand.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008304_00003/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C20-D-8304\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-8304\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Candidate D followed by e repeats a red stem, pale right body, small lozenge-like internal marks, parallel crossbars and dark scalloped left border. The two D samples are an auxiliary same-letter hard-negative comparison, not a test of A-specific exclusivity or an independently established common hand.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8304-capture-3.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=365,210,81,90\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008304_00003/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"8e09cb844765045a79e91d4f7cc1244745f3f2f437cd16353e2784b63e0d285f\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI source inspection,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI observation; no independent expert review\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Post-review manual selection, not blind or preregistered.\", \"Letter identity and liturgical function are candidate readings, not independent labels.\", \"No same-book, same-hand or same-decorator inference from these features.\"], \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"De…\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"\", \"certainty\": \"Candidate D supported by following e; not an A-specific control.\", \"external_references\": []}}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C23-0144-invitatory\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C23-0144-invitatory\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=600,1300,1400,210\"}}, \"sha256\": \"0f83a3289e8ee7d0f9bcf05dbe3f89bc4acb5138024f8eb64a44970e59e44b53\", \"observation\": \"The current line shows a barred christogram followed by passum. No separate pium is visible under the usual expansion Christum. This is a source-image observation, not proof of the full abbreviation expansion.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0144.tiff\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C23-0144-invitatory\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"uub-c23-0144\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The current line shows a barred christogram followed by passum. No separate pium is visible under the usual expansion Christum. This is a source-image observation, not proof of the full abbreviation expansion.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=600,1300,1400,210\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0144.tiff\", \"sha256\": \"0f83a3289e8ee7d0f9bcf05dbe3f89bc4acb5138024f8eb64a44970e59e44b53\", \"image_dimensions\": [2200, 2983], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source comparison,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"C23 source comparison\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"Recolentes xp[m] passum et in ar[...]\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"Recolentes xp[m] passum et in ar[...]\", \"certainty\": \"Provisional reading; abbreviation expansion, erasures and underlay limits are explicit\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\", \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/view.jsf?pid=alvin-record:160517\"]}, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Source identification as the C23 office opening/f71v is corroborated by the edition and text; no medieval folio number is read on this image.\", \"Medieval manuscript words are public-domain source text; modern editorial readings remain separately attributed.\", \"No same-book, direct-copy, stemma, rarity, melodic or performance inference.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C23-0144-condolentes\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C23-0144-condolentes\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=580,1570,1420,350\"}}, \"sha256\": \"0f83a3289e8ee7d0f9bcf05dbe3f89bc4acb5138024f8eb64a44970e59e44b53\", \"observation\": \"Matri sue con- is followed on the next line by -dolentes before procidamus congementes. Alteration is visible around the passage; the original condentes reported in the apparatus is not fully recovered independently from these pixels.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0144.tiff\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C23-0144-condolentes\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"uub-c23-0144\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Matri sue con- is followed on the next line by -dolentes before procidamus congementes. Alteration is visible around the passage; the original condentes reported in the apparatus is not fully recovered independently from these pixels.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=580,1570,1420,350\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0144.tiff\", \"sha256\": \"0f83a3289e8ee7d0f9bcf05dbe3f89bc4acb5138024f8eb64a44970e59e44b53\", \"image_dimensions\": [2200, 2983], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source comparison,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"C23 source comparison\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"Matri sue con / dolentes procidamus congementes\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"Matri sue con / dolentes procidamus congementes\", \"certainty\": \"Provisional reading; abbreviation expansion, erasures and underlay limits are explicit\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\", \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/view.jsf?pid=alvin-record:160517\"]}, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Current reading and editorial reconstruction of underlying text are separate.\", \"Image appearance alone does not date or identify a correcting hand.\", \"Medieval manuscript words are public-domain source text; modern editorial readings remain separately attributed.\", \"No same-book, direct-copy, stemma, rarity, melodic or performance inference.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C23-0144-super\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C23-0144-super\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=1620,1740,340,210\"}}, \"sha256\": \"0f83a3289e8ee7d0f9bcf05dbe3f89bc4acb5138024f8eb64a44970e59e44b53\", \"observation\": \"A crossed small word is visible beneath an interlinear super before morte. The apparent old pro agrees with the apparatus. The separate apparatus attribution of morte to another hand is not assigned to the super correction.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0144.tiff\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C23-0144-super\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"uub-c23-0144\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"A crossed small word is visible beneath an interlinear super before morte. The apparent old pro agrees with the apparatus. The separate apparatus attribution of morte to another hand is not assigned to the super correction.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=1620,1740,340,210\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0144.tiff\", \"sha256\": \"0f83a3289e8ee7d0f9bcf05dbe3f89bc4acb5138024f8eb64a44970e59e44b53\", \"image_dimensions\": [2200, 2983], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source comparison,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"C23 source comparison\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"[crossed pro]; super morte\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"[crossed pro]; super morte\", \"certainty\": \"Provisional reading; abbreviation expansion, erasures and underlay limits are explicit\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\", \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/view.jsf?pid=alvin-record:160517\"]}, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"The old-word reading is provisional; the current super is clearer.\", \"Medieval manuscript words are public-domain source text; modern editorial readings remain separately attributed.\", \"No same-book, direct-copy, stemma, rarity, melodic or performance inference.\", \"No independent correcting-hand identification or date is established for super.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C23-0144-hymn\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C23-0144-hymn\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=1000,1910,600,250\"}}, \"sha256\": \"0f83a3289e8ee7d0f9bcf05dbe3f89bc4acb5138024f8eb64a44970e59e44b53\", \"observation\": \"Between Venite and the first nocturn antiphon, a compact hymn cue with O rosa and fragrantissa-like wording is directly visible. The source cue is shorter than a complete hymn transcription.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0144.tiff\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C23-0144-hymn\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"uub-c23-0144\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Between Venite and the first nocturn antiphon, a compact hymn cue with O rosa and fragrantissa-like wording is directly visible. The source cue is shorter than a complete hymn transcription.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=1000,1910,600,250\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0144.tiff\", \"sha256\": \"0f83a3289e8ee7d0f9bcf05dbe3f89bc4acb5138024f8eb64a44970e59e44b53\", \"image_dimensions\": [2200, 2983], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source comparison,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"C23 source comparison\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"ympn[us] / O rosa / fragrantissa[...]\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"ympn[us] / O rosa / fragrantissa[...]\", \"certainty\": \"Provisional reading; abbreviation expansion, erasures and underlay limits are explicit\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\", \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/view.jsf?pid=alvin-record:160517\"]}, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"The ending and abbreviation expansion are provisional.\", \"A hymn entry here does not establish performance at any other source.\", \"Medieval manuscript words are public-domain source text; modern editorial readings remain separately attributed.\", \"No same-book, direct-copy, stemma, rarity, melodic or performance inference.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C23-0144-patri-parens\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C23-0144-patri-parens\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=600,2300,1400,240\"}}, \"sha256\": \"0f83a3289e8ee7d0f9bcf05dbe3f89bc4acb5138024f8eb64a44970e59e44b53\", \"observation\": \"The first antiphon bottom line has a crossed patriarche-like word, then filius, with patri parens added to the right. It visibly preserves an alteration. The complete corrected sequence requires continuation on the next source page.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0144.tiff\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C23-0144-patri-parens\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"uub-c23-0144\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The first antiphon bottom line has a crossed patriarche-like word, then filius, with patri parens added to the right. It visibly preserves an alteration. The complete corrected sequence requires continuation on the next source page.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0144-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=600,2300,1400,240\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0144.tiff\", \"sha256\": \"0f83a3289e8ee7d0f9bcf05dbe3f89bc4acb5138024f8eb64a44970e59e44b53\", \"image_dimensions\": [2200, 2983], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source comparison,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"C23 source comparison\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"ligna gerit [crossed patriarche] filius patri parens\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"ligna gerit [crossed patriarche] filius patri parens\", \"certainty\": \"Provisional reading; abbreviation expansion, erasures and underlay limits are explicit\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\", \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/view.jsf?pid=alvin-record:160517\"]}, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"The edition reports correction from patriarche filius to patri parens.\", \"The cancelled-word reading remains provisional where crossed.\", \"Medieval manuscript words are public-domain source text; modern editorial readings remain separately attributed.\", \"No same-book, direct-copy, stemma, rarity, melodic or performance inference.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C23-0145-antiphon-opening\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C23-0145-antiphon-opening\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=230,430,1150,220\"}}, \"sha256\": \"03e69d1f4f9b2d757c0895ce5ce1c2ed13fa9f6a6619f9efb38cf8aa158e9f5d\", \"observation\": \"The top text line continues locum querit patriarche filius before Cruce... . Together with the corrected end of0144 it supports the current C23 edited sequence; the sequence is not a newly read original error.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0145.tiff\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C23-0145-antiphon-opening\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"uub-c23-0145\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The top text line continues locum querit patriarche filius before Cruce... . Together with the corrected end of0144 it supports the current C23 edited sequence; the sequence is not a newly read original error.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=230,430,1150,220\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0145.tiff\", \"sha256\": \"03e69d1f4f9b2d757c0895ce5ce1c2ed13fa9f6a6619f9efb38cf8aa158e9f5d\", \"image_dimensions\": [2200, 2617], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source comparison,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"C23 source comparison\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"locum querit patriarche filius; Cruce xp[...]\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"locum querit patriarche filius\", \"certainty\": \"Provisional source reading; continuation and abbreviated Christum/Christus not fully expanded\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\"]}, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"The recto/page transition is corroborated by text and the edition; attachment ordinal alone does not establish it.\", \"No direct-copy, original-error, stemma or physical-book relation established.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C23-0145-condemnation\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C23-0145-condemnation\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=250,680,1140,250\"}}, \"sha256\": \"03e69d1f4f9b2d757c0895ce5ce1c2ed13fa9f6a6619f9efb38cf8aa158e9f5d\", \"observation\": \"Under the crossed condemnation phrase, a replacement is visible, provisionally expanded dampnatur innoxius with the ending continued on the following row. The full old blasphematur vilius is reported by the apparatus; its entire letter sequence is not independently recovered here.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0145.tiff\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C23-0145-condemnation\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"uub-c23-0145\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Under the crossed condemnation phrase, a replacement is visible, provisionally expanded dampnatur innoxius with the ending continued on the following row. The full old blasphematur vilius is reported by the apparatus; its entire letter sequence is not independently recovered here.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=250,680,1140,250\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0145.tiff\", \"sha256\": \"03e69d1f4f9b2d757c0895ce5ce1c2ed13fa9f6a6619f9efb38cf8aa158e9f5d\", \"image_dimensions\": [2200, 2617], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source comparison,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"C23 source comparison\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"[crossed blasphe...] / dāpnatur īnox[...]\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"[crossed blasphe...] / dāpnatur īnox[...]\", \"certainty\": \"Provisional reading; abbreviation expansion, erasures and underlay limits are explicit\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\", \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/view.jsf?pid=alvin-record:160517\"]}, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"dampn- spelling and abbreviation expansion remain provisional.\", \"The apparatus calls the corrected reading uncertain and attributes another hand; neither is silently converted into an independent judgment.\", \"Medieval manuscript words are public-domain source text; modern editorial readings remain separately attributed.\", \"No same-book, direct-copy, stemma, rarity, melodic or performance inference.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C23-0145-eructavit\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C23-0145-eructavit\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=230,880,1160,240\"}}, \"sha256\": \"03e69d1f4f9b2d757c0895ce5ce1c2ed13fa9f6a6619f9efb38cf8aa158e9f5d\", \"observation\": \"The current source has an Eructavit-like cue between the antiphon ending and Calvum rident. Hallqvist attributes that cue to another hand.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0145.tiff\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C23-0145-eructavit\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"uub-c23-0145\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The current source has an Eructavit-like cue between the antiphon ending and Calvum rident. Hallqvist attributes that cue to another hand.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=230,880,1160,240\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0145.tiff\", \"sha256\": \"03e69d1f4f9b2d757c0895ce5ce1c2ed13fa9f6a6619f9efb38cf8aa158e9f5d\", \"image_dimensions\": [2200, 2617], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source comparison,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"C23 source comparison\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"alleluya; eructauit; Calvum rident helise[...]\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"alleluya; eructauit; Calvum rident helise[...]\", \"certainty\": \"Provisional reading; abbreviation expansion, erasures and underlay limits are explicit\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\", \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/view.jsf?pid=alvin-record:160517\"]}, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"No independent identification or dating of the annotating hand.\", \"This common psalm cue and antiphon incipit are not a distinctive witness fingerprint.\", \"Medieval manuscript words are public-domain source text; modern editorial readings remain separately attributed.\", \"No same-book, direct-copy, stemma, rarity, melodic or performance inference.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:C23-0145-later-corrections\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"C23-0145-later-corrections\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=240,1340,1150,440\"}}, \"sha256\": \"03e69d1f4f9b2d757c0895ce5ce1c2ed13fa9f6a6619f9efb38cf8aa158e9f5d\", \"observation\": \"Later lines show an inserted dolorosi-like reading and a reordered Matris mentem-like phrase above cancelled text. The apparatus reports correction from acriores and from mentem matris respectively. Corresponding Fr20274 words are outside the retained capture.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0145.tiff\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"C23-0145-later-corrections\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"uub-c23-0145\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Later lines show an inserted dolorosi-like reading and a reordered Matris mentem-like phrase above cancelled text. The apparatus reports correction from acriores and from mentem matris respectively. Corresponding Fr20274 words are outside the retained capture.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_20/c23/c23-attachment-0145-2200px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=240,1340,1150,440\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/attachment/download/alvin-record:160517/ATTACHMENT-0145.tiff\", \"sha256\": \"03e69d1f4f9b2d757c0895ce5ce1c2ed13fa9f6a6619f9efb38cf8aa158e9f5d\", \"image_dimensions\": [2200, 2617], \"observer\": \"Codex AI source comparison,2026-10-23; exact model/checkpoint not exposed\", \"evidence_kind\": \"C23 source comparison\", \"verification\": \"Provisional AI source reading; no independent expert adjudication\", \"reading\": {\"literal_candidate\": \"dolorosi [above altered text]; matris mentem [above crossed words]\", \"normalized_search_text\": \"dolorosi [above altered text]; matris mentem [above crossed words]\", \"certainty\": \"Provisional reading; abbreviation expansion, erasures and underlay limits are explicit\", \"external_references\": [\"https://lup.lub.lu.se/student-papers/record/9032430/file/9032431.pdf#page=67\", \"https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/view.jsf?pid=alvin-record:160517\"]}, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Both corrected and underlying readings require specialist review.\", \"These sites are not evaluable against the target and provide no agreement count.\", \"Medieval manuscript words are public-domain source text; modern editorial readings remain separately attributed.\", \"No same-book, direct-copy, stemma, rarity, melodic or performance inference.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:T-20274-patri-parens\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"T-20274-patri-parens\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2-1835px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-20274-capture-2-1835px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=80,680,1580,230\"}}, \"sha256\": \"34f88c2977098a87fbc5c2fb796f05092cc83e49574bef2d2e3ac19efe156457\", \"observation\": \"The continuous target line provisionally reads patri parens locum querit patriarche filius, without an obvious cancellation at this selected site. It agrees with the edited/final sequence, not the reported original C23 displacement.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1020274_00002/full/1835,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_a