-10-24\", \"evidence_kind\": \"exploratory physical-scale image measurement\", \"verification\": \"Source-linked; no independent repeat measurement or specialist review\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Approximate scale; ruler endpoints and staff-line centers were selected manually.\", \"Perspective, page waviness, local parchment deformation and ruling curvature are not corrected.\", \"The measured pitch is a page-layout observation, not a book, hand or workshop identifier.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I21-10406-staff-pitch\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I21-10406-staff-pitch\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-10406-capture-4.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10406-capture-4.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=225,145,650,255\"}}, \"sha256\": \"eb77ec83d785842e929432be99d99b579fce102d062d0ecdebe280dbdf9f6677\", \"observation\": \"Three selected four-red-rule music systems are visible. Manual center rows [153,168,184,199], [244,258,274,290] and [337,353,368,383], calibrated with the photographed 20 cm vertical ruler, each yield an approximate mean line interval of 5.586 mm. Arithmetic and exact coordinates are in the E21 result file.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010406_00004/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I21-10406-staff-pitch\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-10406\", \"review_pair_ids\": [], \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Three selected four-red-rule music systems are visible. Manual center rows [153,168,184,199], [244,258,274,290] and [337,353,368,383], calibrated with the photographed 20 cm vertical ruler, each yield an approximate mean line interval of 5.586 mm. Arithmetic and exact coordinates are in the E21 result file.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-10406-capture-4.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=225,145,650,255\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1010406_00004/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"eb77ec83d785842e929432be99d99b579fce102d062d0ecdebe280dbdf9f6677\", \"image_dimensions\": [1000, 647], \"observer\": \"Codex source inspection and manual coordinate selection; arithmetic reproduced by research/continuation_21/ruling_pitch_check.py, 2026-10-24\", \"evidence_kind\": \"exploratory physical-scale image measurement\", \"verification\": \"Source-linked; no independent repeat measurement or specialist review\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Approximate scale; ruler endpoints and staff-line centers were selected manually.\", \"Perspective, page waviness, local parchment deformation and ruling curvature are not corrected.\", \"The measured pitch is a page-layout observation, not a book, hand or workshop identifier.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I22-7292-staff-pitch\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I22-7292-staff-pitch\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-7292-capture-1-1600px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-7292-capture-1-1600px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=250,230,1050,235\"}}, \"sha256\": \"a864bec13a29a315a7df8e910b23118ef76fc631be8e10f97b60ec3b732285f2\", \"observation\": \"Fr 7292 image 1 shows two clear systems of four red music rules. On the registered 1600 px derivative, manually selected line-center rows are [242, 263, 289, 314] and [375, 398, 424, 449]. The calculated mean interval is approximately 5.54 mm after ruler calibration; this is a post-inspection manual measurement, not an independent transcription.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1007292_00001/full/1600,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I22-7292-staff-pitch\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Fr 7292 image 1 shows two clear systems of four red music rules. On the registered 1600 px derivative, manually selected line-center rows are [242, 263, 289, 314] and [375, 398, 424, 449]. The calculated mean interval is approximately 5.54 mm after ruler calibration; this is a post-inspection manual measurement, not an independent transcription.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-7292-capture-1-1600px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=250,230,1050,235\"}}, \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-7292\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1007292_00001/full/1600,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"a864bec13a29a315a7df8e910b23118ef76fc631be8e10f97b60ec3b732285f2\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI visual inspection, 2026-10-24\", \"evidence_kind\": \"image observation\", \"verification\": \"Manual coordinate selection; not independently checked by a second reader or manuscript specialist\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Image coordinates use the top-left origin of the 1600 px JPEG derivative.\", \"The source is catalogued as Codex 1306 in the same MPO metadata system that labels Codex 1505; this is a control label, not independent adjudication.\", \"No hand, workshop, parchment origin, physical identity or historical relationship is inferred.\"], \"image_dimensions\": [1600, 1026]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I22-7292-ruler\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I22-7292-ruler\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-7292-capture-1-1600px.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-7292-capture-1-1600px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=0,50,85,910\"}}, \"sha256\": \"a864bec13a29a315a7df8e910b23118ef76fc631be8e10f97b60ec3b732285f2\", \"observation\": \"The left photographic metric ruler visibly labels the 0 cm and 20 cm marks. Their manually selected center rows are 70 and 948 px in the same 1600 px JPEG; the line-pitch calculation uses this 878 px span.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1007292_00001/full/1600,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I22-7292-ruler\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The left photographic metric ruler visibly labels the 0 cm and 20 cm marks. Their manually selected center rows are 70 and 948 px in the same 1600 px JPEG; the line-pitch calculation uses this 878 px span.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-7292-capture-1-1600px.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=0,50,85,910\"}}, \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-7292\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1007292_00001/full/1600,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"a864bec13a29a315a7df8e910b23118ef76fc631be8e10f97b60ec3b732285f2\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI visual inspection, 2026-10-24\", \"evidence_kind\": \"image observation\", \"verification\": \"Manual ruler endpoint selection; not independently checked by a second reader\", \"interpretation_limits\": [\"The ruler is at the left edge; no correction is made for perspective, parchment curvature or local distortion.\", \"Image coordinates use the top-left origin of the 1600 px JPEG derivative.\"], \"image_dimensions\": [1600, 1026]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I32-8994-red-four-stroke-mark\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I32-8994-red-four-stroke-mark\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-8994.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8994.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=250,45,38,20\"}}, \"sha256\": \"750440678d2312c73fb6eb7eb522ca68034583affeb60208c8fa549dc0e82517\", \"observation\": \"On the upper margin of the first locally retained Fr 8994 capture, a red sign visibly consists of four adjacent vertical strokes. It is consistent with the MPO catalogue's transcription of the old foliation as IIII. The capture does not independently establish its medieval recto/verso assignment.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008994_00001/full/800,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I32-8994-red-four-stroke-mark\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"On the upper margin of the first locally retained Fr 8994 capture, a red sign visibly consists of four adjacent vertical strokes. It is consistent with the MPO catalogue's transcription of the old foliation as IIII. The capture does not independently establish its medieval recto/verso assignment.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/image