ate deo [...] / Secreta [...]\", \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"display_rotation_degrees\": 0, \"observer\": \"Codex AI; unblinded source exposure, no independent adjudication\", \"independent_confirmation\": false, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"15 retained photo views cover nine existing objects. Seven objects have only one of their source views retained in this protocol; no complete canvas or medieval-side coverage is claimed.\", \"General two-column appearance, square notation, different feasts and different book-section genres cannot by themselves establish or exclude a historical codex.\", \"Exact complete hymn/music correspondence, a unique address or physical join is not established. No exhaustive chant census or independent source reading is claimed.\", \"Literal source candidates precede reference lookup; a modern catalogue/reference must not fill difficult source letters silently.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I53-5der-viri\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I53-5der-viri\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/fragmentarium-F-5der.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/fragmentarium-F-5der.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=420,75,245,430\"}}, \"sha256\": \"ea2f1cdf6c73235cbc65664f3d0b74c9c3a7b9de484cc67d4d21c7c92a98aec2\", \"observation\": \"The right-hand music field includes the Galilei/aspicientes-in-celum passage. Its published Beauvais reconstruction membership remains credited separately; a liturgical phrase is not a unique codex fingerprint.\", \"literal_candidate\": \"[...] galilei quid admiramini / aspicientes in celum [...]\", \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://fragmentarium.ms:443/loris/F-5der/BRBL_Box_67_Folder_6_r.jpg/full/800,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"20