atalogue/reference must not fill difficult source letters silently.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I53-25173-offertory\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I53-25173-offertory\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-25173.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-25173.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=435,450,310,115\"}}, \"sha256\": \"7f7014bdfbaf8ae676100f011ffbee52b0276f5ce161fd19569b0808880c3742\", \"observation\": \"A red off.-like rubric precedes an Exultabunt sancti candidate opening in a broad notated field. This is a selected local genre/work cue, not a complete gradual classification or a book exclusion.\", \"literal_candidate\": \"off. Exultabunt sancti [...]\", \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1025173_00001/full/800,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I53-25173-offertory\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"A red off.-like rubric precedes an Exultabunt sancti candidate opening in a broad notated field. This is a selected local genre/work cue, not a complete gradual classification or a book exclusion.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-25173.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=435,450,310,115\"}}, \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-25173\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1025173_00001/full/800,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"7f7014bdfbaf8ae676100f011ffbee52b0276f5ce161fd19569b0808880c3742\", \"image_dimensions\": [800, 737], \"rights_url\": \"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/ma