00,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I53-2872-field\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The preserved Advent-like passage occupies one broad music/text field. No central narrow-column gutter is visible within it. This differs from10349 copying-field design, without excluding section changes or composite volumes.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-2872.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=0,130,600,810\"}}, \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-2872\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1002872_00001/full/800,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"7e142762fd761e1f1bb63dc774676924d5355e27324c3bd5c11b16ff67fe2cdd\", \"image_dimensions\": [800, 1160], \"rights_url\": \"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\", \"attribution\": \"Riksarkivet; National Archives of Sweden\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Ecce ueniet dominus [...]\", \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"display_rotation_degrees\": 0, \"observer\": \"Codex AI; unblinded source exposure, no independent adjudication\", \"independent_confirmation\": false, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"15 retained photo views cover nine existing objects. Seven objects have only one of their source views retained in this protocol; no complete canvas or medieval-side coverage is claimed.\", \"General two-column appearance, square notation, different feasts and different book-section genres cannot by themselves establish or exclude a historical codex.\", \"Exact complete hymn/music correspondence, a unique address or physical join is not established. No exhaustive chant census or independent source reading is claimed.\", \"Literal source candidates precede reference lookup; a modern catalogue/reference must not fill difficult source letters silently.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I53-2873-field\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I53-2873-field\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-2873.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-2873.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=245,80,545,830\"}}, \"sha256\": \"3ae6a5bbb7e0daf7dc553ca9b70d6ac73535b904143971034f52d5989842e993\", \"observation\": \"The surviving music/text uses one broad writing field, with its right extent cropped. Cropping is not treated as a narrow-column gutter or a complete original leaf/fold map.\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1002873_00001/full/800,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I53-2873-field\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The surviving music/text uses one broad writing field, with its right extent cropped. Cropping is not treated as a narrow-column gutter or a complete original leaf/fold map.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-2873.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=245,80,545,830\"}}, \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-2873\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1002873_00001/full/800,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"3ae6a5bbb7e0daf7dc553ca9b70d6ac73535b904143971034f52d5989842e993\", \"image_dimensions\": [800, 1183], \"rights_url\": \"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\", \"attribution\": \"Riksarkivet; National Archives of Sweden\", \"literal_candidate\": null, \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"display_rotation_degrees\": 0, \"observer\": \"Codex 