k place, not that the historical question is exhausted.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I57-8311-sudore\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I57-8311-sudore\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-8311-capture-2.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8311-capture-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=90,15,680,430\"}}, \"sha256\": \"e3b1eba2064492294fa6f75ec6087bbacedd6a636572cf6cfe2ce43e561b46c5\", \"observation\": \"A provisional In sudore opening continues over successive visible staff lines. The bottom contains a Pro-like beginning; its continuation on another photo is a text-order hypothesis, not a demonstrated physical seam.\", \"literal_candidate\": \"[... in sudo]re vultus tui [...]\", \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008311_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I57-8311-sudore\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"A provisional In sudore opening continues over successive visible staff lines. The bottom contains a Pro-like beginning; its continuation on another photo is a text-order hypothesis, not a demonstrated physical seam.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8311-capture-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=90,15,680,430\"}}, \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-8311\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008311_00002/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"e3b1eba2064492294fa6f75ec6087bbacedd6a636572cf6cfe2ce43e561b46c5\", \"image_dimensions\": [1000, 639], \"rights_url\":