gent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I63-iv173-dignare\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/fm-IV173-2.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/fm-IV173-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=375,738,95,142\"}}, \"sha256\": \"e7f71a637b9993c1cf3bdd0a8e6ca067c30b6123d50f01488bb2c173f6d82cd5\", \"observation\": \"The D of Dignare has a red stem, pale right body with two red diamond-like marks, a dark outer contour and dark projections on the left. Its role is a verse within the Te Deum, not necessarily equivalent to the compared Fr1385 initial.\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Dignare…\", \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://fragmenta.kansalliskirjasto.fi/bitstream/handle/10024/1314/F_m_IV_173.pdf?sequence=3\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I63-iv173-dignare\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"finn-iv173\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The D of Dignare has a red stem, pale right body with two red diamond-like marks, a dark outer contour and dark projections on the left. Its role is a verse within the Te Deum, not necessarily equivalent to the compared Fr1385 initial.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/fm-IV173-2.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=375,738,95,142\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://fragmenta.kansalliskirjasto.fi/bitstream/handle/10024/1314/F_m_IV_173.pdf?sequence=3\", \"sha256\": \"e7f71a637b9993c1cf3bdd0a8e6ca067c30b6123d50f01488bb2c173f6d82cd5\", \"image_dimensions\": [1200, 1553], \"rights_url\": \"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\", \"attribution\": \"National Library of Finland\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Dignare…\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI, post-exposure inspection, 2026-11-01; exact model checkpoint unavailable\", \"independent_confirmation\": false, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Selected after previous exposure; not a blind or independent reading.\", \"Decorative function differs or is incompletely matched; feature overlap is not evidence of one book.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I63-1385-dabit\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I63-1385-dabit\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-1385.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-1385.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=90,123,55,67\"}}, \"sha256\": \"99b62db72f5b1b359c7422cf48532c564cce51c83f1485606c7d200502a441b1\", \"observation\": \"The candidate D of Dabit has a red vertical stem and a pale right field with a colored mark. The retained photograph is low resolution; fine edge, inner construction and number or color of marks are not secure.\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Dabit…\", \"normalized_candidate\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1001385_00001/full/800,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I63-1385-dabit\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-1385\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The candidate D of Dabit has a red vertical stem and a pale right field with a colored mark. The retained photograph is low resolution; fine edge, inner construction and number or color of marks are not secure.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-1385.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=90,123,55,67\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1001385_00001/full/800,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"99b62db72f5b1b359c7422cf48532c564cce51c83f1485606c7d200502a441b1\", \"image_dimensions\": [600, 413], \"rights_url\": \"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\", \"attribution\": \"Riksarkivet; National Archives of Sweden\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Dabit…\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI, post-exposure inspection, 2026-11-01; exact model checkpoint unavailable\", \"independent_confirmation\": false, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Selected after previous exposure; not a blind or independent reading.\", \"Decorative function differs or is incompletely matched; feature overlap is not evidence of one book.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I65-8201-ending\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I65-8201-ending\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_65/images/Fr8201-capture-1-native.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_65/images/Fr8201-capture-1-native.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=350,245,760,155\"}}, \"sha256\": \"6716356b5a3fc1776afc9d6ccd75fc9ba2bbecb6f541e6444b800c9335dc4ec2\", \"observation\": \"The first retained photograph begins within the surviving phrase, provisionally pulchrior sponso superno placuit, followed by a red cue. The visible final letter of sponso is o-like; the reading is reference-exposed. The missing beginning is not supplied from the comparator as a local reading.\", \"literal_candidate\": \"pulchrior sponso superno placuit\", \"normalized_candidate\": \"pulchrior sponso superno placuit\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/arkis!R1008201_00001/full/max/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I65-8201-ending\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-8201\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The first retained photograph begins within the surviving phrase, provisionally pulchrior sponso superno placuit, followed by a red cue. The visible final letter of sponso is o-like; the reading is reference-exposed. The missing beginning is not supplied from the comparator as a local reading.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_65/images/Fr8201-capture-1-native.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=350,245,760,155\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/arkis!R1008201_00001/full/max/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"6716356b5a3fc1776afc9d6ccd75fc9ba2bbecb6f541e6444b800c9335dc4ec2\", \"image_dimensions\": [1718, 1156], \"rights_url\": \"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\", \"attribution\": \"Riksarkivet; National Archives of Sweden\", \"literal_candidate\": \"pulchrior sponso superno placuit\", \"normalized_candidate\": \"pulchrior sponso superno placuit\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI, prior reference exposure; 2026-11-01, exact model checkpoint unavailable\", \"independent_confirmation\": false, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"One fragmentary ending, not the beginning or the Fr20106 original.\", \"No independently verified note-by-note transcription, page adjacency, or original side assignment.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I65-8201-next-chant\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I65-8201-next-chant\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_65/images/Fr8201-capture-1-native.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_65/images/Fr8201-capture-1-native.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=325,385,1085,260\"}}, \"sha256\": \"6716356b5a3fc1776afc9d6ccd75fc9ba2bbecb6f541e6444b800c9335dc4ec2\", \"observation\": \"The decorated initial and following text provisionally read Traditur ergo a patre doctoribus, after the surviving pulchrior ending on the same photographed surface. The selection and identification follow exposure to the published study and indexed Vienna sequence.\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Traditur ergo a patre doctoribus\", \"normalized_candidate\": \"Traditur ergo a patre doctoribus\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/arkis!R1008201_00001/full/max/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I65-8201-next-chant\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-8201\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"The decorated initial and following text provisionally read Traditur ergo a patre doctoribus, after the surviving pulchrior ending on the same photographed surface. The selection and identification follow exposure to the published study and indexed Vienna sequence.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_65/images/Fr8201-capture-1-native.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=325,385,1085,260\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/arkis!R1008201_00001/full/max/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"6716356b5a3fc1776afc9d6ccd75fc9ba2bbecb6f541e6444b800c9335dc4ec2\", \"image_dimensions\": [1718, 1156], \"rights_url\": \"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\", \"attribution\": \"Riksarkivet; National Archives of Sweden\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Traditur ergo a patre doctoribus\", \"normalized_candidate\": \"Traditur ergo a patre doctoribus\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI, prior reference exposure; 2026-11-01, exact model checkpoint unavailable\", \"independent_confirmation\": false, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Selected after source and reference exposure; no blind reading.\", \"A shared two-chant sequence does not establish book identity, exact melody, or physical adjacency to Fr20106.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I66-8201-nobilis\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I66-8201-nobilis\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_65/images/Fr8201-capture-1-native.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_65/images/Fr8201-capture-1-native.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=295,645,1110,300\"}}, \"sha256\": \"6716356b5a3fc1776afc9d6ccd75fc9ba2bbecb6f541e6444b800c9335dc4ec2\", \"observation\": \"Following Traditur, the large red N begins a candidate responsory reading Nobilis et pulchra virgo katherina beata. The next written line includes spernit vaga gaudia mundi. Reading and word separation are reference-exposed and provisional.\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Nobilis et pulchra virgo katherina beata [...] spernit vaga gaudia mundi\", \"normalized_candidate\": \"Nobilis et pulchra virgo Katherina beata ... spernit vaga gaudia mundi\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/arkis!R1008201_00001/full/max/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I66-8201-nobilis\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-8201\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Following Traditur, the large red N begins a candidate responsory reading Nobilis et pulchra virgo katherina beata. The next written line includes spernit vaga gaudia mundi. Reading and word separation are reference-exposed and provisional.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_65/images/Fr8201-capture-1-native.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=295,645,1110,300\"}}, \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/arkis!R1008201_00001/full/max/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"6716356b5a3fc1776afc9d6ccd75fc9ba2bbecb6f541e6444b800c9335dc4ec2\", \"image_dimensions\": [1718, 1156], \"rights_url\": \"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\", \"attribution\": \"Riksarkivet; National Archives of Sweden\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Nobilis et pulchra virgo katherina beata [...] spernit vaga gaudia mundi\", \"normalized_candidate\": \"Nobilis et pulchra virgo Katherina beata ... spernit vaga gaudia mundi\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI, post-exposure image reading, 2026-11-02; exact model checkpoint unavailable\", \"independent_confirmation\": false, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"No independent reader has checked the Latin or source extent.\", \"The source-text resemblance with a published edition is not proof of physical manuscript identity, musical identity, ancestry or geographical origin.\"]}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I69-8304-opening-corrected\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I69-8304-opening-corrected\", \"image\": \"image:data/images/mpo-8304-capture-4.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8304-capture-4.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=205,310,660,155\"}}, \"sha256\": \"819f3dd18443e352d4162249aae929ff4b34fcc6cc1913e79dff267d11550529\", \"observation\": \"Re-reading of E49: the word after Katherina appears sollempni[a?], not sollempnitas; it is followed by suscipiat alacriter pia ma[...]. The image is lower-resolution, the reading is reference-exposed and requires independent palaeographic verification. The chant identification is provisional.\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Inclita sancte uirginis / katherine sollempni[a?] suscipiat alacriter pia ma[...]\", \"normalized_candidate\": \"Inclita sanctae virginis Katherinae sollemnia suscipiat alacriter pia ma[...]\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008304_00004/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I69-8304-opening-corrected\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Re-reading of E49: the word after Katherina appears sollempni[a?], not sollempnitas; it is followed by suscipiat alacriter pia ma[...]. The image is lower-resolution, the reading is reference-exposed and requires independent palaeographic verification. The chant identification is provisional.\", \"language\": \"en\"}, \"target\": {\"source\": \"data/images/mpo-8304-capture-4.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=205,310,660,155\"}}, \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-8304\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/v3/arkis!R1008304_00004/full/1000,/0/default.jpg\", \"sha256\": \"819f3dd18443e352d4162249aae929ff4b34fcc6cc1913e79dff267d11550529\", \"image_dimensions\": [1000, 697], \"rights_url\": \"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Inclita sancte uirginis / katherine sollempni[a?] suscipiat alacriter pia ma[...]\", \"normalized_candidate\": \"Inclita sanctae virginis Katherinae sollemnia suscipiat alacriter pia ma[...]\", \"observer\": \"Codex AI, reference-exposed re-reading, 2026-11-02; model checkpoint unavailable\", \"independent_confirmation\": false, \"interpretation_limits\": [\"Reading is provisional and based on the existing 1000-pixel image; higher-resolution request failed DNS.\", \"The abbreviated end of ma[...] is not supplied and no independent reader or manuscript original has confirmed this reading.\", \"This corrects a local transcription and does not establish a manuscript relationship or scholarly novelty.\"], \"supersedes\": \"I49-8304-opening (sollempnitas reading only)\"}, \"independent_confirmation\": false}, {\"id\": \"evidence:I73-8073-felix-terra\", \"type\": \"EvidenceRegion\", \"basis\": \"project_observation\", \"attributed_to\": \"agent:project-ai\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-02\", \"annotation_id\": \"I73-8073-felix-terra\", \"image\": \"image:research/continuation_52/images/Fr8073-capture-3-native.jpg\", \"target\": {\"source\": \"research/continuation_52/images/Fr8073-capture-3-native.jpg\", \"selector\": {\"type\": \"FragmentSelector\", \"conformsTo\": \"http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/\", \"value\": \"xywh=425,465,1100,730\"}}, \"sha256\": \"4deff868fd2a405484f410ffd6a7225c42cfa83b81798ce6e3cfade6384ff118\", \"observation\": \"Provisional reference-assisted reading of the Magnificat antiphon: Felix terra pariens ... in quo corporaliter fons divinitatis ... reos a peccatis solvens duc ad patriam summae claritatis. Red letter prolongations are not silently treated as words.\", \"literal_candidate\": \"Felix terra pariens [...] in quo corporaliter fons divinitatis [...] reos a peccatis solvens duc ad patriam summe claritatis\", \"normalized_candidate\": \"Felix terra pariens caelum trinitatis in quo corporaliter fons divinitatis habitare voluit reos a peccatis solvens duc ad patriam summae claritatis\", \"source_url\": \"https://lbiiif.riksarkivet.se/arkis!R1008073_00003/full/max/0/default.jpg\", \"import_date\": \"2026-11-02\", \"original_annotation\": {\"id\": \"I73-8073-felix-terra\", \"type\": \"Annotation\", \"motivation\": \"describing\", \"fragment_id\": \"mpo-8073\", \"body\": {\"type\": \"TextualBody\", \"value\": \"Provisional reference-assisted reading of the Magnificat antiphon: Felix terra pariens ... in quo corporaliter fons divinitatis ... reos a peccatis solvens duc ad patriam summae claritatis. Red letter pro